{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36975","headline":"大梁见乔诩 · 罗隐","name":"大梁见乔诩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘水春浮岸，淮灯夜满桥。\n六年悲梗断，两地各萍漂。\n刀笔依三事，篇章奏珥貂。\n迹卑甘汩没，名散称逍遥。\n好寺松爲径，空江桂作桡。\n野香花伴落，缸暖酒和烧。\n晋沼寻游凤，秦冠竟叹鴞。\n骨凡鸡犬薄，魂断蕙兰招。\n怅望添燕琯，蹉跎厌鲁瓢。\n败桐方委爨，冤匣正冲霄。\n战代安厘国，封崇孝景朝。\n千年非有限，一醉解无聊。\n漏永灯花暗，炉红雪片销。\n久游家共远，相对鬓俱凋。\n运命从难合，光阴奈不饶。\n到头蓑笠契，两信钓鱼潮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}